'''Tiny Chopper (Deadly)''' is a special stage that was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] and is available on the '''8th''' and '''25th''' of every month. Completing it unlocks [[Li'l Axe Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Axe Cat]]'s [[True Form]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

